This looks great. Thanks for opening up an issue around this @jakelandis!

I don't have a strong preference over keeping this information under `_meta` vs. adding a new top-level `actions` field. 

This may be a separate piece of work - but, there are other places where we're relying on the deprecation message in the ES API in order to determine UA actions. It'd be great if we could update these as well and create a unique action type. The two other actions that come to mind are: 

1 - Old indices that require a reindex - currently relying on the substring: "Index created before..."

```json
...
 "_meta": {
    "actions" : {
      "reindex" : {
        "index_name" : "foo" // I guess we already have access to the index name so this may not be necessary
    }
  }
...
```

2 - Old ML snapshots - currently relying on the substring: "Model snapshot..."

```json
...
  "_meta": {
    "actions" : {
      "upgrade_ml_snapshots" : {
        "job_id":"deprecation_check_job",
         "snapshot_id":"1"
    }
  }
...
```

@jakelandis I think this will be pretty easy to do, but wanted to confirm before I go beyond the prototype stage. This is the format of a full response that we're looking for, right?
```
{
    "_meta": {
        "actions": {
            "remove_settings": {
                "settings": [
                    "discovery.zen.commit_timeout",
                    "discovery.zen.minimum_master_nodes"
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    "ccr_auto_followed_system_indices": [],
    "cluster_settings": [],
    "index_settings": {},
    "ml_settings": [],
    "node_settings": [
         {
            "details": "Remove the [discovery.zen.commit_timeout] setting. (nodes impacted: [keiths-mbp.lan])",
            "level": "critical",
            "message": "Setting [discovery.zen.commit_timeout] is deprecated",
            "resolve_during_rolling_upgrade": false,
            "url": "https://ela.st/es-deprecation-7-unused_zen_settings"
        },
        {
            "details": "Remove the [discovery.zen.minimum_master_nodes] setting. (nodes impacted: [keiths-mbp.lan])",
            "level": "critical",
            "message": "Setting [discovery.zen.minimum_master_nodes] is deprecated",
            "resolve_during_rolling_upgrade": false,
            "url": "https://ela.st/es-deprecation-7-unused_zen_settings"
        }
    ]
}
